LOCKED IDEA
===========

  BUZZ CHECK - a body drift recorder.

Log a drink, hold still, find out how far you've moved from your own normal.
Steady / Wired / Tipsy, printed on a receipt, signed by a bin chicken.

It is a toy, not a test. Say that on the slide.

Full plan:  docs/08-three-ideas.md
Team page:  https://claude.ai/artifact/9XfYmYj56wfpLVB24GecEj


THREE SENSOR CHANNELS, ONE QUESTION
-----------------------------------
All three measure the same thing: drift from YOUR OWN baseline.

  TIER 1  PHONE      accelerometer sway (0.1-3 Hz) + tremor (4-12 Hz)
                     + tap reaction time (report the VARIANCE, not the mean)
                     every device, no hardware          <- THE FLOOR, build first

  TIER 2  CAMERA     finger-on-lens pulse, or magnified tremor (UNSEEN)
                     most devices, needs light          <- THE SHOWPIECE

  TIER 3  THE RING   live HR, HRV, SpO2 over Web Bluetooth
                     laptop Chrome / Android only       <- THE HERO INSTRUMENT

Three independent sensors agreeing is a far stronger claim than any one.
Build the demo around that moment.


