WIRED vs TIPSY - the hypothesis
-------------------------------
  ALCOHOL   sway UP (low band)    tremor can go DOWN
  CAFFEINE  sway ~flat            tremor UP (high band)

  Directions are literature-supported. It is NOT a validated classifier.
  Say so, then collect our own data tonight - coffee, beer, hours awake.
  n=20 of our own readings beats a claim we can't back.


